#DESCRIPTION
Non-periodic 2D 3-face turbulent inflow with PLANETRADIUS length conversion
and a C^2 quintic spatial window (FULL-PIC semi-implicit). Solar wind flows
along -x; x-hi, y-lo, and y-hi are 'wave' field faces ('coupled' particles) and
x-lo is 'coupled' (matching global runs). WAVEBCWINDOW tapers the source smoothly
along x so downstream y-walls have zero perturbation while upstream corners and
side faces inject broadband out-of-plane shear Alfven waves scaled via PLANETRADIUS.

